  3397                                  ; fs_install_exe — install dl_code[] as a new FS_TYPE_FILE_EXE file_table entry.
  3398                                  ;   Caller must have already copied bytecode body (without BC_MAGIC) into dl_code.
  3399                                  ;   Steps:
  3400                                  ;     1. Scan file_contents_used bitmap for a free chunk (idx i, 0..FS_MAX_CONTENTS-1)
  3401                                  ;     2. Scan file_table[] for first non-system non-deleted free entry (slot j)
  3402                                  ;     3. Copy dl_code -> file_contents_pool[i*EXE_CONTENT_CHUNK]
  3403                                  ;     4. Init file_table[j]: name="ludashi_install.exe", type=FS_TYPE_FILE_EXE,
  3404                                  ;                            content_off=i*chunk, content_len=dl_code_len (from top stack)
