     2                              <1> ; font8x8.inc — Complete 8x8 bitmap font for ASCII 0x00..0x7E (shared)
     3                              <1> ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
     4                              <1> ;  Layout: 8 bytes per glyph, one byte per scanline, bit 7 = leftmost pixel.
     5                              <1> ;  The table is indexed by the RAW ASCII code (entries 0x00..0x1F are blank
     6                              <1> ;  padding), so a renderer must do  FONT + ch*8  with NO 0x20 bias.
     7                              <1> ;
     8                              <1> ;  Usage:  %include "common/font8x8.inc"   then reference the label FONT.
